Note on third-party services:

Speech synthesis is provided by the Microsoft Edge online TTS service through
the `edge-tts` client library (LGPL-3.0, installed separately as a dependency,
not vendored here). This project does not contain or redistribute any voice
model. Usage of that service is subject to Microsoft's terms.
